IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q9-ACCOUNT-ELIGIBILITY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-AGE PIC 999.
01 WS-VERIFY PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "ENTER AGE:"
    ACCEPT WS-AGE
    DISPLAY "DO YOU HAVE A VALID ID? (Y/N):"
    ACCEPT WS-VERIFY
    MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-VERIFY) TO WS-VERIFY
    IF WS-AGE >= 18 AND WS-VERIFY = 'Y'
        DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "NOT ELIGIBLE"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
